{"unit_id":"jackyoung022__dsh-session-canvas#card-zh","repo":"jackyoung022/dsh-session-canvas","commit":"44a74fb9fc9dc8cdd0b06afcd7e04f3622eec126","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Session Canvas 是面向 DSH Web 的多会话画布插件，在侧边栏提供入口，并以卡片方式呈现会话。它读取工作区和会话列表，支持整理卡片、在卡片内继续对话、连接会话并把来源会话内容注入目标会话，还能从选中的多个会话创建汇总会话。适合需要并行浏览和衔接多个 DSH 对话的用户。需要在已运行的 DSH Web 中安装，不需要额外配置 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:388-458","lib/index.js:460-584","lib/client.js:175-189"]}
{"unit_id":"jackyoung022__dsh-session-canvas#card-en","repo":"jackyoung022/dsh-session-canvas","commit":"44a74fb9fc9dc8cdd0b06afcd7e04f3622eec126","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Session Canvas is a DSH Web plugin with a sidebar session board. Browse and arrange session cards, continue conversations, pass context between connected sessions, and create summaries from selected sessions. It helps coordinate multiple DSH discussions and requires no extra API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:388-458","lib/index.js:460-584","lib/client.js:175-189"]}
