{"unit_id":"jackyoung022__dsh-session-canvas#feature-1","repo":"jackyoung022/dsh-session-canvas","commit":"44a74fb9fc9dc8cdd0b06afcd7e04f3622eec126","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Session Canvas 的功能「会话画布」：从 Web 侧边栏打开画布，按工作区浏览会话并将选中的会话整理成卡片。可移动和调整卡片，布局保存在浏览器中。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:164-189","lib/client.js:203-210","lib/index.js:388-402"]}
{"unit_id":"jackyoung022__dsh-session-canvas#feature-2","repo":"jackyoung022/dsh-session-canvas","commit":"44a74fb9fc9dc8cdd0b06afcd7e04f3622eec126","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Session Canvas 的功能「卡片内对话」：在会话卡片的输入框发送消息，插件将内容交给对应 session 的 agent，并展示返回的助手回复。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:424-458"]}
{"unit_id":"jackyoung022__dsh-session-canvas#feature-3","repo":"jackyoung022/dsh-session-canvas","commit":"44a74fb9fc9dc8cdd0b06afcd7e04f3622eec126","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Session Canvas 的功能「会话连线与上下文」：连接来源和目标卡片后，插件读取来源会话的近期消息并注入目标会话，作为对话参考上下文。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:370-380","lib/index.js:460-500"]}
{"unit_id":"jackyoung022__dsh-session-canvas#feature-4","repo":"jackyoung022/dsh-session-canvas","commit":"44a74fb9fc9dc8cdd0b06afcd7e04f3622eec126","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Session Canvas 的功能「汇总会话」：选择多个已有会话并提交创建操作，插件整理各会话的近期消息，创建包含这些内容的新 session，可继续追问。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:503-584","lib/client.js:634-652"]}
{"unit_id":"jackyoung022__dsh-session-canvas#feature-5","repo":"jackyoung022/dsh-session-canvas","commit":"44a74fb9fc9dc8cdd0b06afcd7e04f3622eec126","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Session Canvas 的功能「命令与 skill」：在卡片输入框输入斜杠后浏览可用命令和 skills，选择并执行；skill 会作为用户消息发送到目标会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:440-475","test/skill-run.test.js:80-107"]}
